# Phase C demo stage assets — copied locally from legion-stage-runtime by
# scripts/fetch-stage-assets.sh (wasm glue/binary + the gguf model
# weights), never committed. Prod serves both from the webllm-mirror
# volume / the image build context instead — see apps/demo/nginx.conf.
# webllm-stages/ is the pre-C4 local dev path, kept ignored alongside the
# current webllm/ one so old local checkouts don't show it as untracked.
apps/demo/public/wasm/
apps/demo/public/webllm/
apps/demo/public/webllm-stages/
apps/demo/test-results/
apps/demo/playwright-report/

# Same convention for apps/chat (see scripts/fetch-stage-assets.sh and
# apps/chat/chatModelSource.ts's e2e/local-dev test-model escape hatch —
# the `?testModel=1` run needs the same already-fetched qwen3-0.6b-q8_0
# asset apps/demo uses; production serves Qwen3-8B from the webllm-mirror
# volume instead — see apps/chat/nginx.conf).
apps/chat/public/wasm/
apps/chat/public/webllm/
apps/chat/test-results/
apps/chat/playwright-report/

# scripts/prepare-deploy-context.sh output — real copies of sibling-repo
# file: deps, materialized fresh before each `docker compose build`.
.deploy-context/
